# Intentionally empty. This Compose file references no variables at all, so neither key
# this used to carry ever reached the container — they only landed in the VM's .env as
# literal placeholder text (IF-944).
#
# OLLAMA_DEFAULT_MODEL in particular is consumed by nothing: not the Compose file, not
# install.sh. Pulling a model at install time would need wiring that does not exist, so
# the key is dropped rather than left looking functional. The app's own FQDN now arrives
# as the platform's reserved AF_APP_DOMAIN.
#
# The file itself stays, because files-required-compose expects it.
